<title>USA: TALKING POINT - Texaco off despite changes.</title>
<headline>TALKING POINT - Texaco off despite changes.</headline>
<byline>Ian Simpson</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texaco Inc joined the trend of oil-company reorganization on Wednesday, but Wall Street shrugged off the effort by driving its stock down 1-5/8 to 103 by mid-afternoon.</p>
<p>Still, analysts were generally positive about the reorganization, which junks geographical divisions and streamlines operations.</p>
</text>
